      "name": "_validate_qa_report_formatting",
      "line_number": 9014,
      "docstring": "Validates QA report formatting to ensure tables use pre-formatted text blocks.\n\nStrategy:\n1. Split report into sections using numbered headers (e.g., \"1. TITLE\")\n2. For sections expected to contain tables, verify they have ``` code blocks\n3. Within those blocks, detect and flag Markdown table syntax (|---|) \n4. Goal: Tables should be plain text with spacing, not Markdown pipes\n\nReturns ValidationResult indicating pass/fail with specific section errors.",
